{"id":"bbcb80a62faf05ea","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-ultrapower.md","title":"Ultrapower","display":"df-ultrapower — Ultrapower","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-ultrapower","aliases":["17-df-ultrapower"],"display":"df-ultrapower — Ultrapower","depends_on":["[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-ultraproduct]]","[[17-df-ultrafilter]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"statement-compared; constant-family specialization","source_section":"4.1","source_result":"ultrapower definition","source_pages_print":[215],"source_pages_djvu":[231],"legacy_label":"17-df-4.2.2"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-ultrapower"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-ultrapower</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ultrapower — Ultrapower"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed1712b26584150e\" href=\"?note=ed1712b26584150e\" title=\"17-df-ultraproduct\">17-df-ultraproduct</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9e920083cdf9b067\" href=\"?note=9e920083cdf9b067\" title=\"17-df-ultrafilter\">17-df-ultrafilter</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; constant-family specialization"},{"key":"source_section","html":"4.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"ultrapower definition"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>215</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>231</span></div>"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-4.2.2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 是非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9e920083cdf9b067\" href=\"?note=9e920083cdf9b067\" title=\"17-df-ultrafilter\">17-df-ultrafilter</a>。超积谓词及其元理论假设见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ed1712b26584150e\" href=\"?note=ed1712b26584150e\" title=\"17-df-ultraproduct\">17-df-ultraproduct</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathfrak A)_{i\\in I}\">\\((\\mathfrak A)_{i\\in I}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A\">\\(i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A\\)</span> 的常值族。以下定义四元谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L(\\mathfrak A,I,U,\\mathfrak B)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L((\\mathfrak A)_{i\\in I},U,\\mathfrak B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L(\\mathfrak A,I,U,\\mathfrak B)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L((\\mathfrak A)_{i\\in I},U,\\mathfrak B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印刷 p.215（DjVu 231）：常值族的超积为超幂。参数次序和完整结构语义沿用超积接口；本文件4.2.2为本地编号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultraproduct","status":"resolved","id":"ed1712b26584150e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ultraproduct]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"9e920083cdf9b067","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，见 [[17-df-structure]]；$I$ 是非空集合，$\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)$，见 [[17-df-ultrafilter]]。超积谓词及其元理论假设见 [[17-df-ultraproduct]]。$(\\mathfrak A)_{i\\in I}$ 是 $i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A$ 的常值族。以下定义四元谓词 $\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L$。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"9e920083cdf9b067","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，见 [[17-df-structure]]；$I$ 是非空集合，$\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)$，见 [[17-df-ultrafilter]]。超积谓词及其元理论假设见 [[17-df-ultraproduct]]。$(\\mathfrak A)_{i\\in I}$ 是 $i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A$ 的常值族。以下定义四元谓词 $\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L$。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultraproduct","status":"resolved","id":"ed1712b26584150e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，见 [[17-df-structure]]；$I$ 是非空集合，$\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)$，见 [[17-df-ultrafilter]]。超积谓词及其元理论假设见 [[17-df-ultraproduct]]。$(\\mathfrak A)_{i\\in I}$ 是 $i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A$ 的常值族。以下定义四元谓词 $\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathfrak A)_{i\\in I}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L(\\mathfrak A,I,U,\\mathfrak B)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L((\\mathfrak A)_{i\\in I},U,\\mathfrak B).","display":true}],"bytes":1239,"backlinks":[{"id":"b2fa45baaddb4aa3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在 [[17-thm-los]] 的 ZFC 元理论中，$\\mathfrak A$ 为 $L$-结构，$I$ 是非空集合，$U$ 为 $I$ 上的超滤子。$\\mathfrak B$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L(\\mathfrak A,I,U,\\mathfrak B)$，见 [[17-df-ultrapower]]。$[f]_U$ 为该超幂的商类记号。$\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$ 为 [[17-df-elementary-embedding]] 的初等嵌入集合。以下为每个 $a\\in|\\mathfrak A|$ 定义常值函数 $c_a$ 并定义函数 $d$。"},{"id":"97a5b6dd9bfa3001","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L$ (ultrapower predicate, see [[17-df-ultrapower]])"},{"id":"2b5fa486b2ca4645","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L$ (ultrapower predicate, see [[17-df-ultrapower]])"},{"id":"dfe6cf29ee360a19","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ultrapower}_L$ (ultrapower predicate, see [[17-df-ultrapower]])"},{"id":"14765bedc096a21d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在超积构造所用的 ZFC 元理论中，$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，$I$ 为非空集合，$\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)$，见 [[17-df-ultrafilter]]。超幂谓词与初等嵌入集合分别见 [[17-df-ultrapower]]、[[17-df-elementary-embedding]]。自然映射的构造和初等性见 [[17-cor-ultrapower-diagonal-embedding]]。"},{"id":"337f8d2b9e4a90b7","